{"story":{"id":"event-first-contact-critters-60","title":{"zh":"敌对舰船","en":"Hostile Vessels"},"category":"society","kind":"family","image":"art/b5b6c7440ae71484e037.webp","start":"first_contact_critters.60","chapters":2,"visible":true,"excerpt":{"zh":"我们在[This.System.GetName]遇到的舰船似乎有点过时，但仍然武装到了牙齿。这些舰船应该是有人驾驶的，但对任何靠近的物体都展现了敌意。有必要谨慎应对……","en":"The vessels we encountered in the [This.System.GetName] system appear to be somewhat outmoded, but nevertheless armed to the teeth. They seem to be piloted by sentient crews but respond with hostility to any approach. We will have to treat them with caution."},"review":{"status":"reviewed","date":"2026-10-13","reviewer":"c7b-society (resumed)","scope":{"zh":"海盗首次接触：2个事件及阶段衔接。","en":"海盗 first contact: 2 events and the stage hand-off."},"sources":["events/first_contact_NPC_country_types_events.txt:840-889","common/first_contact/01_first_contact_space_fauna_and_NPCs.txt:250-288"],"uncertain":[],"guide":"public/summaries/event-first-contact-critters-60.md"},"tree":{"root":"n0","nodes":{"n0":{"doc":null,"children":["n1"]},"n1":{"doc":"first_contact_critters.60","parent":"n0","via":{"kind":"entry","triggers":[{"zh":"首次接触","en":"First contact"}]},"children":["n2"]},"n2":{"doc":"first_contact_critters.65","parent":"n1","via":{"kind":"bridge","label":{"zh":"进入阶段：pirates_stage_2(难度5)","en":"Stage: pirates_stage_2 (difficulty 5)"},"conditional":true,"source":"content/stories/event-first-contact-critters-60.json","optionIndex":0,"option":"WORRYING"},"children":[]}}}},"chapters":[{"id":"first_contact_critters.60","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"敌对舰船","en":"Hostile Vessels"},"texts":[{"zh":"我们在[This.System.GetName]遇到的舰船似乎有点过时，但仍然武装到了牙齿。这些舰船应该是有人驾驶的，但对任何靠近的物体都展现了敌意。有必要谨慎应对……","en":"The vessels we encountered in the [This.System.GetName] system appear to be somewhat outmoded, but nevertheless armed to the teeth. They seem to be piloted by sentient crews but respond with hostility to any approach. We will have to treat them with caution."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/b5b6c7440ae71484e037.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"WORRYING","label":{"zh":"令人担忧。","en":"Worrying."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"first_contact_critters.65","kind":"bridge","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"bridge","source":"content/stories/event-first-contact-critters-60.json","label":{"zh":"进入阶段：pirates_stage_2(难度5)","en":"Stage: pirates_stage_2 (difficulty 5)"},"story":"event-first-contact-critters-60"}],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/first_contact_NPC_country_types_events.txt","line":839},"names":{"This.System.GetName":{"zh":"这个星系","en":"this system"}}},{"id":"first_contact_critters.65","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"遭遇掠夺者","en":"Pirates Encountered"},"texts":[{"zh":"尽管我们仍然无法与他们建立联络，主要是因为他们并不想理我们，但我们已经可以确认[This.ContactCountry.GetName]是海盗。视觉指示器表明他们的文化很大程度上是生长于太空的，我们观察到的一些表现形式不符合任何一种居住于行星的文明。\n\n不幸的是，他们的船员似乎对民事交流没有任何兴趣。我们从截获的舰见通讯也表明他们主要以海盗活动为生，偶尔也会招募部分文明边缘的元素到他们的贼船上。","en":"Although we have been unable to establish communications with them - mainly because they are unwilling to communicate with us - we have been able to identify the [This.ContactCountry.GetName] as pirates. Visual indicators point to their culture being largely spaceborne, and some phenotypes observed among them match no known planet-dwelling civilizations.\n\nUnfortunately, their crews are completely uninterested in civil discourse. What little we have been able to glean from intercepting intra-fleet communications indicate that they primarily subsist on piracy, occasionally recruiting fringe elements of spacefaring civilizations to their cause."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/3745f25faed16562b16c.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"pirate.5.a","label":{"zh":"真是可悲。","en":"Deplorable."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"galactic_features.387","kind":"option","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","group":"c14013","when":[[[{"type":"other",